/**
 * DriveLedger | Static SEO Metadata Prerenderer
 *
 * Zero-cost build-time static HTML metadata prerenderer.
 * Ingests dist/index.html generated by Vite, resolves route-specific metadata
 * (<title>, <meta name="description">, <link rel="canonical">, OpenGraph, Twitter tags),
 * and emits pre-rendered static HTML entry files across all programmatic SEO routes.
 */

